ns ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n},$ the sum of squared deviations from the mean for the data ${x}_{i}$ can be calculated as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{S}_{xx} & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})^{2} \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}^{2}-\\frac{1}{n}{({\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i})}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we calculate the sum of the ${x}_{i}$ data:\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}{x}_{i}=5+7+8+6+9=35.\n$$\n\nWe are given that ${\\sum }_{i=1}^{5}{x}_{i}^{2}=255.$\n\nFinally, by substituting into the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n{S}_{xx}=255-\\frac{1}{5}(35)^{2}=255-245=10.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7df0c06c-f148-57c2-ab66-c09342c387b3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7df0c06c-f148-57c2-ab66-c09342c387b3" :answer-field/id #uuid "7df0c06c-f148-57c2-ab66-c09342c387b3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-fbb90bff-a9e3-53f2-9e31-2faa07ffcef1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fbb90bff-a9e3-53f2-9e31-2faa07ffcef1" "answer-4c7d59c1-c5ab-558a-8687-f2c12bf613bd" "answer-b4f6e056-c6be-5c14-b14b-419192dbb4aa" "answer-ec0c8cb1-c544-563c-979b-cb93cc05e4f5" "answer-f276c04f-1c06-5aa4-a4b5-a90c6d3eac23"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fbb90bff-a9e3-53f2-9e31-2faa07ffcef1" :answer/id #uuid "fbb90bff-a9e3-53f2-9e31-2faa07ffcef1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{S}_{xx}=10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4c7d59c1-c5ab-558a-8687-f2c12bf613bd" :answer/id #uuid "4c7d59c1-c5ab-558a-8687-f2c12bf613bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{S}_{xx}=14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b4f6e056-c6be-5c14-b14b-419192dbb4aa" :answer/id #uuid "b4f6e056-c6be-5c14-b14b-419192dbb4aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{S}_{xx}=15.5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ec0c8cb1-c544-563c-979b-cb93cc05e4f5"